#: downloads.html:59
msgid ""
"Add Clementine's apt repository to get new versions with the rest of your "
"updates. It has packages for the current releases of Debian and Ubuntu, and "
"Ubuntu-based distributions such as Linux Mint, for 64-bit PCs and ARM."
msgstr "Lisa apt-i Clementine'i tarkvarahoidla ning saad laadida viimaseid versioone koos muude uuendustega. Seal leidub pakette Debiani, Ubuntu ja Ubuntupõhiste distributsioonide jaoks nii 64-bitiste PC-de kui ARM-platvormil arvutite jaoks."

