#: participate.html:23
msgid "Clementine uses GitHub for development and issue tracking."
msgstr "Clementine kasutab arendustööks ja vigade halduseks GitHubi."

#: participate.html:24
msgid ""
"If you have found a bug in Clementine, please head on over to the issue "
"tracker and create a new issue."
msgstr "Kui oled leidnud Clementine's vea, siis palun koosta veateade meie vigade haldussüsteemis."

#: participate.html:27
