#: participate.html:56
msgid ""
"Clementine Remote is hosted on <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-"
"player/Android-Remote\">another GitHub repository</a>."
msgstr "Clementine'i kaugjuhtimispuldi (Clementine Remote) lähtekoodi hallatakse <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Android-Remote\">teises GitHubi lähtekoodihoidlas</a>."

#: participate.html:57
msgid ""
"You can report issues and propose patches on <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Android-Remote/issues\">its bug "
"tracker</a>."
msgstr "Sa võid teatada vigadest või pakkuda koodiparandusi <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/Android-Remote/issues\">meie veahaldussüsteemis</a>."

#: participate.html:58 participate.html:64
msgid ""
"You can translate the interface on <a "
"href=\"https://explore.transifex.com/davidsansome/clementine-remot/\">this "
"Transifex project</a>."
msgstr "Sa võid tõlkida meie kasutajaliidest <a href=\"https://explore.transifex.com/davidsansome/clementine-remot/\">selle Transifexi projekti abil</a>."

#: participate.html:60
msgid "Remote application for iOS"
msgstr "Kaugjuhtimisrakendus iOS-i jaoks"

#: participate.html:62
msgid ""
"Clementine Remote for iPhone and iPad is hosted on <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/iOS-Remote\">another GitHub "
"repository</a>."
msgstr "Clementine'i kaugjuhtimispuldi lähtekoodi iPhone-i ja iPad-i jaoks hallatakse <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/iOS-Remote\">teises GitHub-i lähtekoodihoidlas</a>."

#: participate.html:63
msgid ""
"You can report issues and propose patches on <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/iOS-Remote/issues\">its bug "
"tracker</a>."
msgstr "Sa võid teatada vigadest või pakkuda koodiparandusi <a href=\"https://github.com/clementine-player/iOS-Remote/issues\">tema veahaldussüsteemis</a>."

#: participate.html:68
msgid "Social Networking"
msgstr "Suhtlusvõrgustikud"

#: participate.html:70
msgid ""
"We'd love to see you support Clementine by joining us on your favourite "
"social networking site!"
msgstr "Meile meeldiks, kui toetad Clementine liitudes meiega oma tavapärases suhtlusvõrgustikus!"

#: participate.html:74
msgid "Clementine on Facebook"
msgstr "Clementine Facebookis"

#: participate.html:79
msgid "Donation"
msgstr "Annetus"

#: participate.html:80
msgid ""
"Currently, we do not need money and as so we do not accept money donation. "
"If you like our software and want to help us, you can <a href=\"#social-"
"networking\">support us</a> and spread the word."
msgstr "Parasjagu meil ei ole raha vaja ning seega meie ei kogu rahalisi toetusi. Kui sulle Clementine meeldib ja sa soovid aidata, siis <a href=\"#social-networking\">toeta meid</a> ning räägi meist teistele."

#: participate.html:81
msgid ""
"You can also help by <a href=\"#collaborate\">participating to the software "
"development, as explained above</a>."
msgstr "Samuti võid sa aidata <a href=\"#collaborate\">osaledes tarkvara arendamisel nii nagu eespool on kirjeldatud</a>."

#: participate.html:82
msgid ""
"But if you still want to spend some money to make us happy, you can make a "
"donation to one of these charity organizations we like"
msgstr "Kui sa siiski tahad meie rõõmustamiseks natuke raha kulutada, siis võid annetada mõnedele meile meeldivatele heategevusorganisatsioonidele"

#: participate.html:82
msgid "and let us know:"
msgstr "ning anna meile sellest teada:"

